Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:33.67,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}烛华不吝照耀 光芒终将殆尽
