Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:47.31,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}发得出声音的玩具也好
